  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Revamp of Pertamina Refinery, through Government of Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Revamp of Pertamina Refinery Units Feasibility Study (FS) in Indonesia is to determine the most cost-effective way of modernizing Pertamina&apos;s refinery units in accordance with its Refinery Master Plan. Pertamina&apos;s Master Plan addresses the need to modernize the country&apos;s refining configuration and capabilities to address the need to process changing sources and quality of crude oils, upgrading the refined product requirements to be consistent with improved environmental standards, and to improve the efficiency and economic viability of the individual refineries.</narrative>
  </description>
